msgid ""
"Edit the menu structure as JSON. Each item can have: name, icon, command "
"(run through the shell) or action (a session action: lock, logout, leave, "
"switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), submenu (array of items), "
"or separator (true)."
msgstr ""
"Cuir struchtúr an roghchláir in eagar mar JSON. Is féidir na nithe seo a "
"bheith ag gach mír: name, icon, command (rite tríd an bhlaosc) nó action "
"(gníomh seisiúin: lock, logout, leave, switchUser, suspend, hibernate, "
"reboot, shutdown), submenu (eagar míreanna) nó separator (true)."

